{"id":629,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"徳育を土台に自立を育む人間教育","feature_description":"徳育を土台に自立を育む人間教育を教育の中心に据え、教科の学びと学校生活を結び付けながら、生徒が自ら考え行動する力を育てます。基礎となる知識や技能を着実に身に付けるとともに、探究、対話、行事、部活動などの経験を通して、多様な仲間と協働し課題に向き合います。一人ひとりが自分の目標を見つけ、学びを深め、社会や世界に関わる視野を広げられるよう支える教育です。","clubs":[{"id":15275,"name":"女子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15276,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15277,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15278,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15279,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15280,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15281,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15282,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15283,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15284,"name":"洋弓部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15285,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15286,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15287,"name":"囲碁将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15288,"name":"交通研究・写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kankura.jp/life/club/","verified